amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[140px] pb-[90px] max-w-[880px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">The product</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[40px] md:text-[62px] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Two agents.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">One engine underneath.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[18px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px]\">Gravity makes the marketing that brings people in. Pulsar answers them before they go somewhere else. They share the same brand memory, so what one learns the other already knows.</p></section><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pb-[110px]\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-7 md:px-[42px] pt-[44px] pb-10\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">The marketing agent</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[38px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.015em] mb-4\">Gravity</h2><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-7\">Gravity reads your website, builds a strategy from it, plans the month, drafts every post, carousel and reel to fill that month, and waits for you to tap approve. It also runs your campaigns, your creator collaborations, your inbox and your SEO — most of which nobody realises it does.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8\"><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Strategy &amp; ICP</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Content planning</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Content creation</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Reels &amp; video</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Campaigns</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Approvals</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Competitor tracking</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Influencer marketing</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-faint px-[13px] py-[5px]\">+<!-- -->6<!-- --> more</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[14.5px] font-semibold px-[26px] py-[13px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/product/gravity\">Explore <!-- -->Gravity<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">₹10,000 / month</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] px-7 md:px-[42px] pt-[44px] pb-10\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">The outreach agent</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[38px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.015em] mb-4\">Pulsar</h2><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-7\">Pulsar answers every enquiry on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, asks the questions you would have asked, scores what comes back, and hands you only the people worth your afternoon. Broadcasts, automation and voice calling run from the same place.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8\"><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">WhatsApp</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Leads &amp; scoring</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Broadcasts</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Voice calling</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">AI agents</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Automation</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Knowledge base</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 border border-rule rounded-full px-[13px] py-[5px]\">Email &amp; SMS</span><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-faint px-[13px] py-[5px]\">+<!-- -->2<!-- --> more</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[14.5px] font-semibold px-[26px] py-[13px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/product/pulsar\">Explore <!-- -->Pulsar<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">₹15,000 / month</span></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px] text-center\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[28px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">Or have our team <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">run both for you.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[520px] mx-auto mb-9\">Same agents underneath, with our team planning, producing and reporting on top of them — including the on-ground work software cannot do.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-rule-2 text-ink-2 text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full hover:border-gold hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\" href=\"/services\">See managed services <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.a